[{"id":"inner_sea_combat:class_feature:cavalier_archetype_spellscar_drifter","label":"Spellscar Drifter","value":"Text","prose":[{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"The Spellscar Desert is a dangerous wasteland into which few venture without a guide. Spellscar drifters have made themselves at home in these badlands. When not scouring the desert for forgotten treasures or magic hidden by the region's shifting magic-dead zones, a Spellscar drifter might hire himself out as a guide, bodyguard, or assassin. There are even a few Spellscar drifters who are temporarily deputized by the Grand Duchy of Alkenstar to perform law enforcement tasks beyond the reach of the city's normal constabulary. Spellscar drifters are self-reliant and always keep their firearms loaded-in the Spellscar Desert, a rider with a slow draw doesn't live long."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false}],"applies":{"All":[{"Compare":{"lhs":{"ClassLevel":"cavalier"},"op":"Gte","rhs":{"Const":1}}},{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"inner_sea_combat:class_feature:cavalier_archetype_spellscar_drifter"},"count":1}},{"Not":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierProficiencies"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"Tactician"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierCavaliersCharge"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierBanner"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierBonusFeat"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierGreaterTactician"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierMightyCharge"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierDemandingChallenge"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool":"archetype","tag":"CavalierMasterTactician"}},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"RuleTag":{"pool"